{
  "uid": "ankilabs-search-postgres",
  "title": "AnkiLabs - Search & PostgreSQL",
  "description": "AnkiLabs lookup stages, row distributions, pool pressure and read-only PostgreSQL telemetry. No query text or statement statistics are collected.",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": false,
  "tags": ["homelab-monitoring"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {"from": "now-6h", "to": "now"},
  "links": [{"type": "dashboards", "tags": ["homelab-monitoring"], "title": "Monitoring", "asDropdown": true, "keepTime": true}],
  "templating": {"list": [
    {"name": "metrics", "label": "Prometheus", "type": "datasource", "query": "prometheus"},
    {"name": "logs", "label": "Loki", "type": "datasource", "query": "loki"},
    {"name": "request_id", "label": "Request ID contains (query-time only)", "type": "textbox", "query": "", "current": {"text": "", "value": ""}},
    {"name": "fingerprint", "label": "Query fingerprint contains (query-time only)", "type": "textbox", "query": "", "current": {"text": "", "value": ""}},
    {"name": "backend_pid", "label": "PG backend PID contains (query-time only)", "type": "textbox", "query": "", "current": {"text": "", "value": ""}}
  ]},
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1, "type": "text", "title": "Investigate without raw queries",
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 24, "h": 5},
      "options": {"mode": "markdown", "content": "All data is **ankilabs-only**. Compare stage mean with stage sample/error counts; stages overlap, so their times must not be added into a request total. Started events locate the last stage when a process dies before completion. Pools expose size/available/waiting/max separately: these states are **not additive**. Row histograms are phase-specific observations, not SQL execution plans. Request IDs, fingerprints and backend PIDs remain query-time fields, never indexed labels.\n\nPostgreSQL requires the separate monitoring role/Secret preflight. HTTP scrape success alone does not prove database collector success. No slow SQL text, statement collector or extension is enabled. [Database runbook](https://github.com/liav-hasson/homelab/blob/main/k8s/platform/monitoring/runbook.md#database)"}
    },
    {
      "id": 2, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Sentence stage mean duration by outcome",
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 5, "w": 12, "h": 8},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${metrics}"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "s", "min": 0}, "overrides": []},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (stage, outcome) (increase(ankilabs_sentence_lookup_stage_duration_seconds_sum{namespace=\"ankilabs\"}[15m])) / sum by (stage, outcome) (increase(ankilabs_sentence_lookup_stage_duration_seconds_count{namespace=\"ankilabs\"}[15m]))", "legendFormat": "{{stage}} {{outcome}}"}]
    },
    {
      "id": 3, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Sentence stage sample count / 15 minutes (including errors)",
      "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 5, "w": 12, "h": 8},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${metrics}"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "min": 0}, "overrides": []},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (stage, outcome) (increase(ankilabs_sentence_lookup_stage_duration_seconds_count{namespace=\"ankilabs\"}[15m]))", "legendFormat": "{{stage}} {{outcome}}"}]
    },
    {
      "id": 4, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Dictionary stage mean duration by outcome",
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 13, "w": 12, "h": 7},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${metrics}"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "s", "min": 0}, "overrides": []},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (stage, outcome) (increase(ankilabs_dictionary_lookup_stage_duration_seconds_sum{namespace=\"ankilabs\"}[15m])) / sum by (stage, outcome) (increase(ankilabs_dictionary_lookup_stage_duration_seconds_count{namespace=\"ankilabs\"}[15m]))", "legendFormat": "{{stage}} {{outcome}}"}]
    },
    {
      "id": 5, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Dictionary stage sample count / 15 minutes (including errors)",
      "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 13, "w": 12, "h": 7},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${metrics}"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "min": 0}, "overrides": []},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (stage, outcome) (increase(ankilabs_dictionary_lookup_stage_duration_seconds_count{namespace=\"ankilabs\"}[15m]))", "legendFormat": "{{stage}} {{outcome}}"}]
    },
    {
      "id": 6, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Sentence DB pool: separate states, per pod",
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 20, "w": 12, "h": 7},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${metrics}"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "min": 0}, "overrides": []},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "ankilabs_sentence_lookup_db_pool_connections{namespace=\"ankilabs\"}", "legendFormat": "{{pod}} {{state}}"}]
    },
    {
      "id": 7, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Dictionary DB pool: separate states, per pod",
      "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 20, "w": 12, "h": 7},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${metrics}"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "min": 0}, "overrides": []},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "ankilabs_dictionary_lookup_db_pool_connections{namespace=\"ankilabs\"}", "legendFormat": "{{pod}} {{state}}"}]
    },
    {
      "id": 8, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Mean rows observed per search phase",
      "description": "Candidate, matched and returned are distinct phases. Not all requests necessarily reach every phase.",
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 27, "w": 12, "h": 7},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${metrics}"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "min": 0}, "overrides": []},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (phase) (increase(ankilabs_sentence_lookup_search_rows_sum{namespace=\"ankilabs\"}[15m])) / sum by (phase) (increase(ankilabs_sentence_lookup_search_rows_count{namespace=\"ankilabs\"}[15m]))", "legendFormat": "{{phase}}"}]
    },
    {
      "id": 9, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Search row histogram sample count / 15 minutes",
      "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 27, "w": 12, "h": 7},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${metrics}"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "min": 0}, "overrides": []},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (phase) (increase(ankilabs_sentence_lookup_search_rows_count{namespace=\"ankilabs\"}[15m]))", "legendFormat": "{{phase}}"}]
    },
    {
      "id": 10, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Search row distribution: cumulative observations by bucket / 15 minutes",
      "description": "Cumulative buckets, including zero and +Inf. These are sample counts, not a row-rate or percentile.",
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 34, "w": 24, "h": 8},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${metrics}"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "min": 0}, "overrides": []},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (phase, le) (increase(ankilabs_sentence_lookup_search_rows_bucket{namespace=\"ankilabs\"}[15m]))", "legendFormat": "{{phase}} <= {{le}}"}]
    },
    {
      "id": 11, "type": "table", "title": "PostgreSQL connection and collector health: 1 success, 0 failure",
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 42, "w": 12, "h": 8},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${metrics}"},
      "targets": [
        {"refId": "A", "expr": "pg_up{namespace=\"ankilabs\"}", "instant": true, "format": "table"},
        {"refId": "B", "expr": "pg_scrape_collector_success{namespace=\"ankilabs\"}", "instant": true, "format": "table"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 12, "type": "timeseries", "title": "PostgreSQL client connections by state and wait type",
      "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 42, "w": 12, "h": 8},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${metrics}"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "min": 0}, "overrides": []},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (state, wait_event_type) (pg_stat_activity_count{namespace=\"ankilabs\",datname=\"ankilabs\",backend_type=\"client backend\"})", "legendFormat": "{{state}} {{wait_event_type}}"}]
    },
    {
      "id": 13, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Oldest observed PostgreSQL transaction by state",
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 50, "w": 12, "h": 7},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${metrics}"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "s", "min": 0}, "overrides": []},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "max by (state) (pg_stat_activity_max_tx_duration{namespace=\"ankilabs\",datname=\"ankilabs\"})", "legendFormat": "{{state}}"}]
    },
    {
      "id": 14, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Database backends and configured server-wide connection ceiling",
      "description": "The ceiling includes reserved/server-wide capacity. This is not a claim that all connections are available to lookups.",
      "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 50, "w": 12, "h": 7},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${metrics}"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "min": 0}, "overrides": []},
      "targets": [
        {"refId": "A", "expr": "pg_stat_database_numbackends{namespace=\"ankilabs\",datname=\"ankilabs\"}", "legendFormat": "ankilabs backends"},
        {"refId": "B", "expr": "pg_settings_max_connections{namespace=\"ankilabs\"}", "legendFormat": "server max_connections"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 15, "type": "timeseries", "title": "PostgreSQL commits and rollbacks / 15 minutes",
      "description": "A rollback is not necessarily a user-visible error. Correlate with request outcomes and SQLSTATE.",
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 57, "w": 12, "h": 7},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${metrics}"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "min": 0}, "overrides": []},
      "targets": [
        {"refId": "A", "expr": "increase(pg_stat_database_xact_commit{namespace=\"ankilabs\",datname=\"ankilabs\"}[15m])", "legendFormat": "commits"},
        {"refId": "B", "expr": "increase(pg_stat_database_xact_rollback{namespace=\"ankilabs\",datname=\"ankilabs\"}[15m])", "legendFormat": "rollbacks"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 16, "type": "timeseries", "title": "PostgreSQL 18 checkpoints / 15 minutes",
      "description": "Uses pg_stat_checkpointer (PostgreSQL 17+), not removed checkpoint fields in pg_stat_bgwriter.",
      "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 57, "w": 12, "h": 7},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${metrics}"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "min": 0}, "overrides": []},
      "targets": [
        {"refId": "A", "expr": "increase(pg_stat_checkpointer_num_timed_total{namespace=\"ankilabs\"}[15m])", "legendFormat": "scheduled"},
        {"refId": "B", "expr": "increase(pg_stat_checkpointer_num_requested_total{namespace=\"ankilabs\"}[15m])", "legendFormat": "requested"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 17, "type": "timeseries", "title": "PostgreSQL PVC used / capacity",
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 64, "w": 12, "h": 7},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${metrics}"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "bytes", "min": 0}, "overrides": []},
      "targets": [
        {"refId": "A", "expr": "max(kubelet_volume_stats_used_bytes{namespace=\"ankilabs\",persistentvolumeclaim=\"data-postgres-0\"})", "legendFormat": "used"},
        {"refId": "B", "expr": "max(kubelet_volume_stats_capacity_bytes{namespace=\"ankilabs\",persistentvolumeclaim=\"data-postgres-0\"})", "legendFormat": "capacity"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 18, "type": "timeseries", "title": "PostgreSQL locks by mode (not blocked-request counts)",
      "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 64, "w": 12, "h": 7},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${metrics}"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "min": 0}, "overrides": []},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (mode) (pg_locks_count{namespace=\"ankilabs\",datname=\"ankilabs\"})", "legendFormat": "{{mode}}"}]
    },
    {
      "id": 19, "type": "logs", "title": "Lookup breadcrumbs by request ID / fingerprint",
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 71, "w": 24, "h": 10},
      "datasource": {"type": "loki", "uid": "${logs}"},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "{namespace=\"ankilabs\",app=~\"sentence-lookup|dictionary-lookup\"} | json | request_id=~`.*${request_id:regex}.*` | query_fingerprint=~`.*${fingerprint:regex}.*`", "queryType": "range"}],
      "options": {"showTime": true, "wrapLogMessage": true, "sortOrder": "Descending"}
    },
    {
      "id": 20, "type": "logs", "title": "PostgreSQL stderr: native severity, normalized level and raw fallback",
      "description": "EOF with an open transaction retains pg_severity=LOG and gets level=WARNING. PID is query-time only; correlate within a narrow time range because PIDs can be reused.",
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 81, "w": 24, "h": 10},
      "datasource": {"type": "loki", "uid": "${logs}"},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "{namespace=\"ankilabs\",app=\"postgres\",container=\"postgres\"} | json | db_backend_pid=~`.*${backend_pid:regex}.*`", "queryType": "range"}],
      "options": {"showTime": true, "wrapLogMessage": true, "sortOrder": "Descending"}
    }
  ]
}
